        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: La Senza, L Brands Inc.\n- Places: Canada, Columbus, Ohio\n- Concepts: Brand ownership, franchise model, retail operations\n\nFacts:\n- L Brands Inc., formerly known as Limited Brands Inc. and The Limited Inc., is an American fashion retailer based in Columbus, Ohio.\n- The La Senza brand is currently owned by L Brands Inc.\n- L Brands Inc. operates and owns La Senza stores in Canada.\n- L Brands Inc. uses a franchise model to operate La Senza stores outside Canada.",
